Package: introTree
Title: Tree-Aware Filtering of D-Statistic Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ruben", "Muller-Perol", email = "rubenmullerperol@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Filters tables of D-statistic (ABBA-BABA) results so that only
    trios consistent with a rooted species tree are kept. Reports p-values
    and multiple-testing adjusted p-values for information only; significance
    is based on the Z-score threshold. The DStatFilter class stores the tree
    and table and provides methods for filtering and saving results.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/RMP-deb/introTree
BugReports: https://github.com/RMP-deb/introTree/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: ape, methods, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
